  "description": "Marketing wallpaper screenshots in Mock Mode; captures only, no payments or publishing.",
  "details": "WALLPAPER SELECTION: Colors navy/sunset/beige then Artemis II looking-back-at-earth, edge-of-lunar-day, setting-earth, in-eclipse. The screenshot schema requires canonical page names: the seven wallet occurrences map in that order to wallet-<themeName> in marketing/artwork/source/screenshots.json. Image captures wait for Wallpaper image loaded for <themeName>; palette captures wait for none. No persistence or app-state injection. Both platforms: --evidence screenshots --no-record. Capture only; no payments or publishing. Artemis: each mock currency (sat, usd, eur, gbp) gets a different collection wallpaper, then the wallet is captured per currency via the unit switcher (sat setting-earth, usd edge-of-lunar-day, eur in-eclipse, gbp looking-back-at-earth; each differs from the album default for that unit so Apply appears).",
